 ("What is the best tonneau cover for a 2024+ Tacoma?",
  "For most trucks, the BAKFlip MX4 448446 (5 ft bed) or 448447 (6 ft). It has polymer-reinforced aluminum panels that BAK says are 22% stronger than the original MX4, a 400 lb evenly distributed rating, auto-latches, a flush fold against the cab and a 5-year warranty, for $1,099.99 at RealTruck. If you carry weight on top, the Extang Solid Fold ALX is rated for 600 lb. If you want the whole bed open, the RetraxPRO EZ-Off is the pick."),
